   "en": "Konyakusha ni Uwakisareta Reijou wa Ikoku no Kowamote Meishu ni Dekiaisareru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "婚約者に浮気された令嬢は異国の強面盟主に溺愛される"
   },
   {
    "ja": "婚約者に浮気された令嬢は異国の強面盟主に溺愛される～呪いで猫になりましたが、毎日モフられています～"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Konyakusha ni Uwakisareta Reijou wa Ikoku no Kowamote Meishu ni Dekiaisareru: Noroi de Neko no narimashita ga, Mainichi Mofurareteimasu"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Young Lady Whose Fiancé Cheated on Her Is Doted on by the Tough Leader of a Foreign Country"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Young Lady Whose Fiancé Cheated on Her Is Doted on by the Tough Leader of a Foreign Country: She Was Cursed to Turn Into a Cat, but She Gets Petted Every Day"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Miranda, who is not good at talking, somehow turns into a cat on the day she is engaged to the man she loves! Her family, unaware that Miranda has turned into a cat, kicks her out of their mansion, and when she goes to her fiancé's house to ask for help, she witnesses him cheating on her, and she ends up wandering around at a loss.\n\nBut then she is saved by Burke, a tough-looking young man who loves animals. Burke has terrible luck with women and hates them, but he is kind to Miranda, who he thinks is a cat, and Burke's kindness heals Miranda's wounded heart. Then, one day, something happens that allows her to return to her human form...\n\n---\n[Original Web Novel](https://ncode.syosetu.com/n0761hk/)"
  },
